$HL,0$$FG,11$PSYCHE // SIGNAL FIELD$$FG$

$ID,2$A visualization-only neural signal field. Pulses, layers, weights and
a simulated loss curve are drawn for atmosphere. There is no network,
no training, no data collection and no external I/O.

$ID,2$$LK,"Run Psyche",A="FI:::/Hermes/Apps/Psyche/Run.HC"$

$ID,2$Keys: SPACE pause, R reseed, ESC exit.
